SYNTHESIS
  No sampled bounded-ratio L7 row exceeds its cap.
  The thinnest sampled margins are still far larger than the HYP-2728
  generated atom strip scale, which supports a sequential proof: generated
  compatibility first, Delsarte packet classification second, and only then
  a finite resonance atlas plus non-resonant 2D discrepancy lemma for L7.
